      cx_dv_exception=>raise_from_message( ).
    ENDIF.

    LOOP AT it_dati ASSIGNING <fd_line>.
      TRANSFER <fd_line> TO id_file.
    ENDLOOP.

    CLOSE DATASET id_file.
    IF sy-subrc = 0.
      CONCATENATE 'Download' id_file 'OK' INTO ld_mess SEPARATED BY space.
